Z||000001||Formula||06-07-2000||08:59 PM||||its sealed.  its for a 10" sub.  I dont remember the dimensions but I will get those in the morning when I go out to look at it.  It sounds really good in the car, but its about 2x as loud outside the car.  People always ask me how many 12"s I have lol.||||reg||1
