Z||000007||Formula||06-08-2000||10:20 AM||||anymore questions?<P>make sure that the bottom is near exact or the sub may hit the AC.  Most 10" subs dont have the excursion to hit it but if you use a really expensive one you should test it out some and put a grill on it.  But anything under $150 should be fine.||||reg||1
